#: submissions/sections.py:10
msgid "Demographics"
msgstr "Demographics"

#: submissions/sections.py:11
msgid "demographics.introduction"
msgstr ""
"We'd like to know a bit more about you so we can tailor our questions. We "
"will also use this information to understand if children and young people "
"with diabetes from different backgrounds have different experiences at "
"school. All questions in this section are mandatory, but you may select "
"'Prefer not to say' for some."

#: submissions/sections.py:18
msgid "q4.child.title"
msgstr "Do you identify as a:"

#: submissions/sections.py:27
msgid "q5.parent.title"
msgstr "Relationship to your child with diabetes"

#: submissions/sections.py:36
msgid "q6.child.title"
msgstr "What type of diabetes do you have?"

#: submissions/sections.py:37
msgid "q6.parent.title"
msgstr "What type of diabetes does your child have?"

#: submissions/sections.py:46
msgid "q7.child.title"
msgstr "At what age were you diagnosed with diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:47
msgid "q7.parent.title"
msgstr "At what age was your child diagnosed with diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:56
msgid "q8.child.title"
msgstr "Which of the following best describes your ethnicity?"

#: submissions/sections.py:57
msgid "q8.parent.title"
msgstr "Which of the following best describes your child's ethnicity?"

#: submissions/sections.py:66
msgid "q9.child.title"
msgstr "What stage of education are you in?"

#: submissions/sections.py:67
msgid "q9.parent.title"
msgstr "What stage of education is your child in?"

#: submissions/sections.py:80
msgid "q10.child.title"
msgstr "Which type of school or education do you attend?"

#: submissions/sections.py:81
msgid "q10.parent.title"
msgstr "Which type of school or education does your child attend?"

#: submissions/sections.py:94
msgid "q11.child.title"
msgstr "Was the decision to home educate related to your diabetes diagnosis?"

#: submissions/sections.py:95
msgid "q11.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Was your decision to home educate related to your child's diabetes diagnosis?"

#: submissions/sections.py:104
msgid "q12.child.title"
msgstr "Are you eligible for free school meals?"

#: submissions/sections.py:105
msgid "q12.parent.title"
msgstr "Is your child eligible for free school meals?"

#: submissions/sections.py:115
msgid "School Health Care Plans"
msgstr "School Health Care Plans"

#: submissions/sections.py:116
msgid "healthcare_plans.introduction"
msgstr ""
"We would like to know if you and your child have received formal support in "
"managing their diabetes alongside their education."

#: submissions/sections.py:123
msgid "q13.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Does your child have a school healthcare plan specifically for their "
"diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:125
msgid "q13.hint"
msgstr ""
"This is a plan made with your diabetes team and school. It could be an "
"informal or a formal plan, such as Individual Healthcare Plans (IHP), "
"Records of Needs, or Education, Health and Care Plans (EHCP)."

#: submissions/sections.py:137
msgid "q14.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Does the school healthcare plan that's in place cover all your child's "
"diabetes needs at school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:146
msgid "q15.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Does your child's school have a direct contact within your child's diabetes "
"team if they need advice or support?"

#: submissions/sections.py:156
msgid "Managing Diabetes"
msgstr "Managing Diabetes"

#: submissions/sections.py:157
msgid "managing_diabetes.introduction"
msgstr ""
"This section asks about your/your child's diabetes treatment. We will use "
"this information to see if children and young people using different "
"diabetes technologies have different experiences at school."

#: submissions/sections.py:164
msgid "q16.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Do you need to administer insulin or monitor blood glucose to manage your "
"diabetes when in school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:165
msgid "q16.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Does your child need to administer insulin or monitor blood glucose to "
"manage their diabetes when in school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:178
msgid "q17.child.title"
msgstr "How do you administer insulin in school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:179
msgid "q17.parent.title"
msgstr "How does your child administer insulin in school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:181
msgid "q17.hint"
msgstr "Select all that apply"

#: submissions/sections.py:189
msgid "q18.child.title"
msgstr "How do you monitor blood glucose levels in school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:190
msgid "q18.parent.title"
msgstr "How does your child monitor blood glucose levels in school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:192
msgid "q18.hint"
msgstr "Select all that apply"

#: submissions/sections.py:200
msgid "q19.parent.title"
msgstr "Can you follow/monitor your child's blood glucose remotely?"

#: submissions/sections.py:209
msgid "q20.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Are you able to contact your child's school during the day if you are "
"concerned about their diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:218
msgid "q21.child.title"
msgstr ""
"If you use a smartphone or smartwatch to manage your diabetes, are you able "
"to use it during lesson time at school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:219
msgid "q21.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"If your child uses a smartphone or smartwatch to manage their diabetes, are "
"they able to use it during lesson time at school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:228
msgid "q22.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Are you offered a private room at school for diabetes care, even if you "
"don't use it?"

#: submissions/sections.py:229
msgid "q22.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Is your child offered a private room at school for diabetes care, even if "
"they don't use it?"

#: submissions/sections.py:231
msgid "q22.hint"
msgstr ""
"E.g. For administering insulin, checking blood glucose, changing pump set, "
"or anything else related to diabetes care"

#: submissions/sections.py:239
msgid "q23.child.title"
msgstr "Are you allowed to manage diabetes in the classroom if required?"

#: submissions/sections.py:240
msgid "q23.parent.title"
msgstr "Is your child allowed to manage diabetes in the classroom if required?"

#: submissions/sections.py:242
msgid "q23.hint"
msgstr "This includes checking blood glucose or giving insulin."

#: submissions/sections.py:250
msgid "q24.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Is there a trained member of staff at school who can help you with diabetes "
"management?"

#: submissions/sections.py:251
msgid "q24.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Is there a trained member of staff at school who can help your child with "
"diabetes management?"

#: submissions/sections.py:253
msgid "q24.hint"
msgstr ""
"This includes checking blood glucose, administering insulin, and providing "
"support in emergencies. This training should be provided by the diabetes "
"team."

#: submissions/sections.py:261
msgid "q25.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Does your school provide enough information about school meals for carb-"
"counting?"

#: submissions/sections.py:262
msgid "q25.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Does your child's school provide enough information about school meals for "
"carb-counting?"

#: submissions/sections.py:264
msgid "q25.hint"
msgstr ""
"This includes information about carbohydrate content and portion sizes to "
"help you/your child adjust insulin to match."

#: submissions/sections.py:273
msgid "Impact on Education"
msgstr "Impact on Education"

#: submissions/sections.py:274
msgid "education_impact.introduction"
msgstr ""
"This section asks about how your/your child's diabetes impacts your/their "
"education."

#: submissions/sections.py:281
msgid "q26.child.title"
msgstr ""
"In the past year, how many times have you missed one or more lessons in any "
"given day to attend diabetes-related hospital appointments?"

#: submissions/sections.py:282
msgid "q26.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"In the past year, how many times has your child missed one or more lessons "
"in any given day to attend diabetes-related hospital appointments?"

#: submissions/sections.py:284
msgid "q26.hint"
msgstr ""
"This could include routine appointments for the diabetes clinic or other "
"appointments with a PDSN, dietitian, psychologist etc. (not inpatient "
"hospital stays)"

#: submissions/sections.py:291
msgid "q27.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Are your absences for diabetes-related appointments authorised by your "
"school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:292
msgid "q27.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Are your child's absences for diabetes-related appointments authorised by "
"their school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:294
msgid "q27.hint"
msgstr ""
"School absences due to health appointments should not be classed as "
"unauthorised."

#: submissions/sections.py:302
msgid "q28.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Has your school attendance records been negatively impacted by attending "
"diabetes clinic appointments?"

#: submissions/sections.py:303
msgid "q28.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Has your child's school attendance records been negatively impacted by "
"attending diabetes clinic appointments?"

#: submissions/sections.py:305
msgid "q28.hint"
msgstr ""
"School absences due to attending health appointments should not reduce the "
"percentage attendance."

#: submissions/sections.py:313
msgid "q29.child.title"
msgstr ""
"In the past year, how many days have you had off school/home education "
"because of illness related to your diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:314
msgid "q29.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"In the past year, how many days has your child had off school/home education "
"because of illness related to their diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:316
msgid "q29.hint"
msgstr ""
"This could include staying off school at home or include a hospital admission"

#: submissions/sections.py:323
msgid "q30.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Have you ever had to move schools due to difficulties in managing your "
"diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:324
msgid "q30.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Has your child ever had to move schools due to difficulties in managing "
"their diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:333
msgid "q31.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Have you ever been excluded from any of the below activities because of your "
"diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:334
msgid "q31.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Has your child ever been excluded from any of the below activities because "
"of their diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:336
msgid "q31.hint"
msgstr "Select all that apply"

#: submissions/sections.py:344
msgid "q32.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Do you feel that your diabetes affects your performance in school/home "
"education?"

#: submissions/sections.py:345
msgid "q32.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Do you feel that your child's diabetes affects their performance in school/"
"home education?"

#: submissions/sections.py:354
msgid "q33.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Do your teachers have a good understanding of how diabetes can affect "
"learning?"

#: submissions/sections.py:355
msgid "q33.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Do your child's teachers have a good understanding of how diabetes can "
"affect learning?"

#: submissions/sections.py:357
msgid "q33.hint"
msgstr ""
"E.g. When blood glucose is too high or low, it may affect concentration or "
"memory."

#: submissions/sections.py:365
msgid "q34.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Have you ever been offered any reasonable adjustments because of your "
"diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:366
msgid "q34.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Has your child ever been offered any reasonable adjustments because of their "
"diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:368
msgid "q34.hint"
msgstr ""
"(e.g. additional time in exams, snacks or drinks during class, fast passes "
"for lunch queues)"

#: submissions/sections.py:377
msgid "Social and Emotional Impact"
msgstr "Social and Emotional Impact"

#: submissions/sections.py:378
msgid "wellbeing.introduction"
msgstr ""
"This section asks about how your/your child's diabetes impacts your/their "
"wellbeing at school."

#: submissions/sections.py:385
msgid "q35.child.title"
msgstr ""
"Have you ever felt left out or treated differently by other students or "
"staff members because of your diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:386
msgid "q35.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Has your child ever felt left out or treated differently by other students "
"or staff members because of their diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:395
msgid "q36.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"Have you ever lost income due to taking time off work to attend your child's "
"school for diabetes care?"

#: submissions/sections.py:397
msgid "q36.hint"
msgstr ""
"E.g. Attending your child's school for diabetes management or your child "
"being sent home because of diabetes-related illness."

#: submissions/sections.py:405
msgid "q37.child.title"
msgstr ""
"How often do you feel anxiety or stress related to your diabetes while "
"you're at school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:406
msgid "q37.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"How often do you feel anxiety or stress related to your child's diabetes "
"while they're at school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:415
msgid "q38.child.title"
msgstr ""
"How well has your school supported you to manage your diabetes safely "
"alongside your education?"

#: submissions/sections.py:416
msgid "q38.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"How well has your school supported you to manage your child's diabetes "
"safely alongside their education?"

#: submissions/sections.py:425
msgid "q39.child.title"
msgstr ""
"How well has your diabetes team supported you to manage your diabetes safely "
"alongside your education?"

#: submissions/sections.py:426
msgid "q39.parent.title"
msgstr ""
"How well has your diabetes team supported you to manage your child's "
"diabetes safely alongside their education?"

#: submissions/sections.py:435
msgid "q40.child.title"
msgstr "What has worked well?"

#: submissions/sections.py:436
msgid "q40.parent.title"
msgstr "What has worked well?"

#: submissions/sections.py:438
msgid "q40.hint"
msgstr ""
"What has been helpful about the support you/your child has at school to "
"manage your/their diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:445
msgid "q41.child.title"
msgstr "What hasn’t worked well?"

#: submissions/sections.py:446
msgid "q41.parent.title"
msgstr "What hasn’t worked well?"

#: submissions/sections.py:448
msgid "q41.hint"
msgstr ""
"What difficulties have you faced in managing your/your child's diabetes at "
