msgid ""
"If you wish to enter the prize draw to win a £50 voucher, please click this "
"link:"
msgstr ""
"If you wish to enter the prize draw to win a £50 voucher, please click this "
"link:"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/confirmation.html:20
msgid "confirmation.issues_content"
msgstr ""
"If completing this survey has raised issues that you would like to discuss "
"further, please contact your diabetes team or reach out to a diabetes "
"charity, who can provide information and support about diabetes, and the "
"emotional, social, psychological, or practical difficulties associated with "
"diabetes."

#: submissions/templates/submissions/confirmation.html:26
msgid "Breakthrough T1D UK website"
msgstr "Breakthrough T1D UK website"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/confirmation.html:31
msgid "Diabetes Research and Wellness Foundation (DWRF) website"
msgstr "Diabetes Research and Wellness Foundation (DWRF) website"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/confirmation.html:36
msgid "Diabetes UK helpline and website"
msgstr "Diabetes UK helpline and website"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:13
msgid "What is the survey about?"
msgstr "What is the survey about?"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:17
msgid "what_is_the_survey_about_content"
msgstr ""
"This survey is about your experiences at school (or your child’s experience) "
"since being diagnosed with diabetes. We want to understand what is working "
"well and what could be better."

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:21
msgid "What will happen to my answers?"
msgstr "What will happen to my answers?"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:25
msgid "what_will_happen_to_my_answers_content"
msgstr ""
"The National Paediatric Diabetes Audit (NPDA) team at the Royal College of "
"Paediatrics and Child Health (RCPCH) will analyse the responses and create:"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:27
msgid "what_will_happen_to_my_answers_local"
msgstr ""
"A local report for your diabetes team to help them plan improvements to "
"their service"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:28
msgid "what_will_happen_to_my_answers_national"
msgstr ""
"A national report to support improvements in diabetes care across wider "
"areas  "

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:33
msgid "Who should complete the survey?"
msgstr "Who should complete the survey?"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:38
msgid "who_should_complete_the_survey_cyp"
msgstr ""
"Children and young people who have diabetes and are attending primary "
"school, secondary school, college, or are home schooled/educated."

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:39
msgid "who_should_complete_the_survey_parents"
msgstr ""
"Parents/carers of children and young people of all ages who have diabetes "
"and are in nursery, primary school, secondary school, college, or are home "
"schooled/educated. If you have multiple children with diabetes in education, "
"please complete one response per child."

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:44
msgid "Is the survey anonymous?"
msgstr "Is the survey anonymous?"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:48
msgid "is_the_survey_anonymous_content"
msgstr ""
"Yes\n"
"\n"
"We do not ask for names or details which could identify you, so your local "
"diabetes clinic or \n"
"school will not know which answers are yours. If you are completing the "
"survey in clinic, you \n"
"should have the opportunity to do so in private.\n"
"\n"
"If you would like to enter the prize draw for a £50 voucher, we will ask you "
"to enter your email address. \n"
"Your email address will not be linked to your survey responses and will be "
"deleted as soon as a winner is selected."

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:52
msgid "Completing the survey?"
msgstr "Completing the survey?"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:56
msgid "completing_the_survey_content"
msgstr ""
"The survey should take 10-15 minutes to complete. \n"
"\n"
"To complete the survey, select the answer(s) that best match your "
"experience, or use the free text boxes to type your response where they "
"appear. \n"
"There are no right or wrong answers, please just tell us what you think and "
"chose what you think is the most appropriate answer to the question.  \n"
"When you have completed your answer, select the ‘NEXT’ button to move to the "
"next page. \n"
"\n"
"If you change your mind, you can click the ‘PREV’ button at the bottom of "
"the page to return to the previous page. \n"
"\n"
"Your participation is entirely voluntary. You do not have to take part if "
"you do not want to. You can exit the survey at any point by closing your web "
"browser.If you do not wish to answer some of the questions, you do not have "
"to give a reason."

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:60
msgid "Questions or help?"
msgstr "Questions or help?"

#: submissions/templates/submissions/front_matter.html:64
msgid "questions_or_help_content"
msgstr ""
"If you have any questions or would like help completing the survey please "
"call the NPDA team on 020 7092 6137 or email npda@rcpch.ac.uk. \n"
"\n"
"To begin the survey, please select the ‘NEXT’ button below: "

